{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action adventure game where the last remaining human must fight to save the world from evil creatures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy tough enemies by overcoming obstacles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting skills consume the player's energy, use skills wisely to survive on the battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/extras/c87af669224c3deca3debb1961ce5871.poster.avif?t=1761926439\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/extras/c87af669224c3deca3debb1961ce5871.webm?t=1761926439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/extras/c87af669224c3deca3debb1961ce5871.mp4?t=1761926439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemies to progress continuously, use your skills to overcome obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two different area hit skills, use them carefully as using skills consumes stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't waste too much time, you will encounter enemies and obstacles again</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficult enemies await you at the gates, kill them carefully using your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure not to skip save points and don't miss the health points scattered around while fighting enemies. Kill your enemies with your special skills while trying to pass obstacles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/extras/7c96e366a563783b226e888aafa75f1d.poster.avif?t=1761926439\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/extras/7c96e366a563783b226e888aafa75f1d.webm?t=1761926439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/extras/7c96e366a563783b226e888aafa75f1d.mp4?t=1761926439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stamina Usage</strong> - The player has a certain amount of stamina. Running fast, Sword Attack, Double Jump and using abilities consume stamina.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Mechanics</strong> - You can defeat enemies more easily by combining magical abilities with Sword usage</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities</strong> - Has 2 different area strike abilities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environments</strong> - Dungeons covered with traps and moving platforms can cause you big problems</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Attack</strong> - Remember that the enemies you defeat will come with every second you lose</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Before Progression</strong> - Your health points increase over time and fill up to a certain level as long as you do not take damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/extras/a5c8b40b46c96139a7dc2e5541f2fb55.poster.avif?t=1761926439\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/extras/a5c8b40b46c96139a7dc2e5541f2fb55.webm?t=1761926439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/extras/a5c8b40b46c96139a7dc2e5541f2fb55.mp4?t=1761926439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mana points support your abilities, sprint, jumping, combat mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reload is set to unlimited according to time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Pass</strong> - Enemies will become more aggressive and stronger with each level passed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The obstacles will become more difficult, so the most important structure will be to proceed carefully.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838270?t=1761926439","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/7f23af19c5cd66add8ddae33ab57d5c6a1660550/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761926439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/7c7932d3ef898922e8b5277bdd048b4aede09d06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761926439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/7c7932d3ef898922e8b5277bdd048b4aede09d06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761926439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3839480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action adventure game where the last remaining human must fight to save the world from evil creatures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy tough enemies by overcoming obstacles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting skills consume the player's energy, use skills wisely to survive on the bat